## Import

In order to import an existing Conduktor Gateway Group, you need the group's unique name.

For example, using an [`import` block](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/import) :
{{tffile "examples/resources/conduktor_gateway_group_v2/import.tf"}}

Using the `terraform import` command:
```shell
terraform import conduktor_gateway_group_v2.example my-group-name
```
